# This directory is the Docker build context (see build.sh). The image build reads only
# the client jars staged in dist/ and the Maven tarball in maven/; keep everything else,
# such as the oras download of publish_docker.sh, out of the build context.
*
!dist
!maven
# Should the build context ever grow, keep VCS metadata, registry credentials and local
# environment files out of it regardless.
**/.git
**/.npmrc
**/.env*
